	Page 3-60  Substitute the following format section, which
	documents the value of /STREAMS=n:

		CREATE

		Creates a queue (opposite of DELETE).

		Format

		CX  CREATE  [/STREAMS=n]  queue-type queuename

		where

		/STREAMS=n	indicates the number of streams you're
				creating for this queue (the default is
	|			1 and the range is 1 through 10). This
				switch is valid only for batch queues.

		queue-type	specifies the type of queue you're
				creating.

		queuename	is the name of the new queue.
























